  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nExpression: ((4.7)² - (1.3)²)/(4.7 - 1.3)\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n(a² - b²) = (a - b)(a + b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n((4.7)² - (1.3)²)/(4.7 - 1.3)\n\n= ((4.7 - 1.3)(4.7 + 1.3))/(4.7 - 1.3)\n\n= (4.7 + 1.3) = 6\n\n**The correct answer is option 4.**",
